# Part III — Physical Interpretation

# 1. The Vacuum Frequency

Vacuum Frequency Theory proposes that:

[
\nu_{\mathrm{vac}}
==================

2.99792458\times10^{23},\mathrm{Hz}
]

represents the natural propagation rate of electromagnetic gauge structure through vacuum.

The theory interprets this as the number of invariant gauge domains traversed in one light-second.

---

# 2. Photon Geometry

The photon is modeled as two equilateral gauge bosons joined base-to-base, forming a rhombic wave structure.

